                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “ ‘Etediaki iltung'ana ooitobiru enkitanyaanyukoto nagueta aashu enamuruni, olminong to Laitoriani, entoki naaitobiruni too nkaik o ltung'ani arriyia, neirragieki aaisudoo.’ Newal iltung'ana pooki aajo, ‘Esai.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
